- Curriculum Server to send its own messages.
- Curriculum Flow to send application messages.
- Other provisioned applications to consume messaging services.
- Authentication services to request OTP delivery without implementing provider-specific logic.

Layer C — Tenant Messaging Configuration

Each provisioned school must have its own independently configurable messaging settings, including:

- SMS enabled/disabled.
- WhatsApp enabled/disabled.
- Preferred communication channel.
- Sender identity.
- Approved WhatsApp sender configuration.
- Message templates and branding.
- Language and locale.
- Consent and opt-out policies.
