Layer D — Application and User Experience

Provide suitable interfaces for:

- Central platform administrators.
- School administrators.
- Authorized Curriculum Flow administrators.
- Relevant staff and operational users.
- End users receiving notifications.

A tenant must never be able to access or modify another tenant's messaging configuration, messages, credentials, templates, or usage records.

